Full chats: the events of task tskP2p7eVEtMPi in byre (read_task_events with task_id tskP2p7eVEtMPi).

## Summary

Audited the codebase at ac7de7d for structural complexity and selected a bounded cleanup of shared picture tooling across Home, When, Celebrate, HCA-Team and Wiki.

Before: imageTools required app state for an always-true image-search flag, repeated in four app models and fabricated by Wiki; controls threaded the flag through their tool objects.
Now: imageTools takes only its API prefix, and every caller and the development documentation use that shape. Search controls retain their existing visible behavior, including the plain picker's hidden search button.

Before: uploaded files and preview URLs occupied parallel maps keyed by the same upload name.
Now: a single map holds each upload's {file, url} record, keeping its preview and multipart upload paired by construction.

Validation passed: 39 browser checks compared baseline and current functions with real DOM, File, FormData and blob URLs and stubbed network dependencies; all five app module graphs linked; all 14 changed JavaScript modules passed syntax checks; focused image-search tests, go vet ./..., and diff checks passed. Full signed-in app flows were not exercised. Mail and redirect paths were left alone because their differences encode distinct behavior. No schema, production-data or visible UI changes. The requested final merge from main reported already up to date, with no conflicts or additional edits.

